00:07:52.071 --> 00:07:53.873
the people that are
in the coal mines,

00:07:53.873 --> 00:07:55.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
et cetera, et cetera,
that are doing this stuff

00:07:55.808 --> 00:07:57.043
because I think people,

00:07:57.043 --> 00:07:58.277
