00:08:43.556 --> 00:08:45.758
it is absolutely an
energy of the future,

00:08:45.758 --> 00:08:48.361 align:start size:97% position:3%
and we are the largest coal
producer in the nation.

00:08:49.729 --> 00:08:51.931 align:start size:97% position:3%
