the winter from cold,

00:09:01.007 --> 00:09:04.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that's why I'm very
proud of what Wyoming does

00:09:04.377 --> 00:09:06.445 align:start size:88% position:13%
cuz we make everybody's
lives better.

00:09:06.445 --> 00:09:07.980
When you flip on that switch,

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:10.216 align:start size:97% position:3%
there's an awfully good
chance that that electricity

00:09:10.216 --> 00:09:13.553
