00:11:07.099 --> 00:11:08.668
He's got three daughters.

00:11:08.668 --> 00:11:12.104 align:start size:97% position:3%
He's absolutely the most
wonderful person in the world,

00:11:12.104 --> 00:11:14.607
and here you've got
an administration

00:11:14.607 --> 00:11:16.375 align:start size:88% position:13%
that's doing everything
in their power

00:11:16.375 --> 00:11:18.878
to make it so that he can't
succeed in that business.

00:11:18.878 --> 00:11:20.579 align:start size:84% position:16%
And one of the
things I often talk

00:11:20.579 --> 00:11:22.515 align:start size:84% position:16%
about when I talk
about my upbringing,

00:11:22.515 --> 00:11:25.418
and the fact that I did come
from pretty humble beginnings,

00:11:25.418 --> 00:11:27.453
is, it's only in
the United States

00:11:27.453 --> 00:11:29.989
that we've always had
the freedom to succeed.

00:11:29.989 --> 00:11:31.724
And we now have
an administration

00:11:31.724 --> 00:11:34.860
and a group of people who
don't want us to succeed.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:38.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
They wanna dictate who
prospers and who does not,

00:11:38.264 --> 00:11:41.367 align:start size:97% position:3%
and that is not America,
that isn't what we stand for.

00:11:41.367 --> 00:11:43.135 align:start size:81% position:19%
We all have the
freedom to succeed

00:11:43.135 --> 00:11:44.670
no matter what we came from.

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.338
- So jumping back for a second,

00:11:46.338 --> 00:11:49.075
you mentioned sort
of small population,

00:11:49.075 --> 00:11:51.844 align:start size:84% position:16%
sixth largest state
geographically.

00:11:51.844 --> 00:11:53.612
Related to the COVID situation,

00:11:53.612 --> 00:11:55.581
everyone thinks, okay,
Florida did it so right.

00:11:55.581 --> 00:11:56.816
I'm a living example of that.

00:11:56.816 --> 00:11:58.284
That's why I moved here.

00:11:58.284 --> 00:12:01.287 align:start size:97% position:3%
People don't really talk
about Wyoming related to that.

00:12:01.287 --> 00:12:02.922
What was it like in
the midst of all this

00:12:02.922 --> 00:12:04.857
because you've got a sort
