00:12:13.532 --> 00:12:15.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Well, you had
Washington, DC, doing it,

00:12:15.468 --> 00:12:16.869 align:start size:81% position:19%
but I'm also going
to be critical

00:12:16.869 --> 00:12:19.271
