00:12:32.351 --> 00:12:35.855 align:start size:97% position:3%
to a group of people that
only have a very narrow focus

00:12:35.855 --> 00:12:38.491
of everything that they
do, and our governor did,

00:12:38.491 --> 00:12:40.793
