00:18:05.551 --> 00:18:07.753
we have separation of
powers for a reason.

00:18:07.753 --> 00:18:09.254 align:start size:84% position:16%
And I know she
keeps coming back to

00:18:09.254 --> 00:18:11.056 align:start size:84% position:16%
"That are either
for the constitution

00:18:11.056 --> 00:18:13.492
