00:18:13.492 --> 00:18:16.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's a binary that
makes no sense whatsoever,

00:18:16.195 --> 00:18:17.963 align:start size:88% position:13%
and especially as
someone who is actually

00:18:17.963 --> 00:18:19.665
a constitution attorney,

00:18:19.665 --> 00:18:21.567
it's actually kind of
a stupid statement,

00:18:21.567 --> 00:18:24.136 align:start size:97% position:3%
and it's a stupid statement
