00:18:24.136 --> 00:18:27.072
including that it
ignores the vast,

00:18:27.072 --> 00:18:29.141 align:start size:84% position:16%
it ignores the
constitution itself.

00:18:29.141 --> 00:18:30.909
But here's one of the
fundamental things

00:18:30.909 --> 00:18:32.377 align:start size:81% position:19%
I think people
need to understand

00:18:32.377 --> 00:18:34.379
about what Liz Chaney is doing,

00:18:34.379 --> 00:18:36.381 align:start size:84% position:16%
is, we have a
separation of powers.

00:18:36.381 --> 00:18:38.951 align:start size:84% position:16%
The legislative branch
