And if you don't wanna
live by those rules,

00:37:25.810 --> 00:37:27.678
then don't make 'em
for other people.

00:37:27.678 --> 00:37:30.948
And so we now have a
segment of society,

00:37:30.948 --> 00:37:33.217
and I refer to them, I
guess, as the elitist,

00:37:33.217 --> 00:37:35.753
although I don't even think
that that encompasses it,

00:37:35.753 --> 00:37:37.188
but they are the
people who think

00:37:37.188 --> 00:37:39.890 align:start size:97% position:3%
