Harriet Hageman what to do,

00:37:39.890 --> 00:37:42.360
pretty much all day every day.

00:37:42.360 --> 00:37:44.228
My own parents didn't
tell me what to do

00:37:44.228 --> 00:37:45.963
when I was three
and four years old.

00:37:45.963 --> 00:37:48.899
That's what I started out
